RedSpark includes MiniCPM5-2B model files from openbmb/MiniCPM5-2B-Base and
openbmb/MiniCPM5-2B.

The model files are distributed under the Apache License 2.0. The upstream
model license and attribution are retained alongside the weights:

- model/redspark/model-weights/minicpm5-2b-final-reference/LICENSE
- model/redspark/model-weights/minicpm5-2b-final-reference/README.md
- model/redspark/model-weights/base/README.md

RedSpark's own model source (model/redspark/), training, inference and
data-flywheel code is project-authored. The upstream MiniCPM reference source is
vendored read-only under third_party/MiniCPM/ and is likewise Apache License 2.0;
see the LICENSE file in that directory.

MiniCPM5-2B's Llama architecture support is provided by the Hugging Face
Transformers package (transformers>=5.6,<6).
